# Copy harness profile `stage-like`: ratio-floor.env, then this file (stack.mjs
# layers both over harness.env). The pre-mainnet gate runs on it
# (node scripts/copy-harness/stack.mjs restart worker --profile stage-like, the
# same for api; run.mjs --profile stage-like). No secrets here.
#
# TEST ONLY: every SQL statement of the api and the worker waits 8 ms first,
# Stage's round trip to its Postgres (db-rtt.mjs; stack.mjs loads it with
# `node --import`). Local Postgres answers in ~0 ms, so without it an order's
# meter transactions never cost the seconds they cost on Stage.
COPY_HARNESS_DB_RTT_MS=8
# As on Stage (also in ratio-floor.env): every mainnet leader on the fast source.
COPY_LIVE_FAST_SOURCE=all
